Hand edits of the TES 1.1 models, applied by utils/build_models.sh.

- `TesTask.executors` stays optional, so that task views without executors
  (for example `MINIMAL`) parse. `TesTask::new` sets it to the executors it
  is given.
- `TesState` reads states that the spec doesn't define as `Unknown`, which
  the spec defines as the safe default, instead of keeping them in
  `Unrecognized`. The enum stays `Copy`. `Unknown` moves to the end, because
  `#[serde(other)]` must be on the last variant.
- `ListTasksParams` is hand-written and lives in
  `lib/src/clients/tes/list_tasks_params.rs`; `models` re-exports it.
- `TesOutput.path` writes its URL as an autolink (`<...>`), so that
  rustdoc renders it as a link and doesn't warn about a bare URL.

